<title>USA: Spacelabs needed Burdick to grow earnings.</title>
<headline>Spacelabs needed Burdick to grow earnings.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spacelabs Medical Inc said its recent acquisition of Burdick Inc was based on need to get its core U.S. business back on a growth path.</p>
<p>It said it would not be able grow its revenue stream or meet the expectation that earnings will increase until the benefits of the Burdick acquisition and diversification initiatives of the company take effect.</p>
</text>
